om/v/t64.5771-25/491824052_840338134974044_1441857360551667786_n.png?_nc_cat=105&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=GEDvo2ZANRkQ7kNvwFA9hNf&_nc_oc=Adpg5xU-cFSOnLm62h15jQjB1TDP53IoF9TM-ng9IJUZgleXsWpI9i8Z1LnBmAqO6WQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQSIptSAb33yJfAC-BDrQAabQrVUPWY2AonyPmGuNR5ovg&oe=6B0DBABE"}, {"file_name": "s1.png", "id": "1731821457403870", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491822784_1731821460737203_1976246460782187442_n.png?_nc_cat=109&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=RcsVAqQ9G1wQ7kNvwFHUnsK&_nc_oc=AdrCUFPkQJTxZxBFh2z79Qh_zSQjlOVYVX7BXCPWUHWFsuttp8i_r7o7HpQ8YpYE1vk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQSbr6YetEO0tpWg6hqyBCi1kB8dULYT9nVBTovSBrmFnA&oe=6B0D9D2F"}, {"file_name": "s3.png", "id": "973142324806852", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491828831_973142328140185_9053732965349338513_n.png?_nc_cat=111&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=bBfurPGWGxEQ7kNvwHZvkgZ&_nc_oc=AdpgZp1nqh6KW5KU7epOgu0TMjMDj-J9H8K42Jz173VNYcD2Y1d9OREI3c24kDomJ-A&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQQElhNU9ek068f48MaD_pA0zCuMyfRyrdIxWe4lPwlaeg&oe=6B0DA216"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Cover Landscape 2560x1440 a.png", "id": "1672661304127956", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491827273_1672661307461289_3410736206105956984_n.png?_nc_cat=101&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=J1CCmVr9xAcQ7kNvwGQpH82&_nc_oc=AdpYWFOtapfo9srDKyap0BEQNWcTKhRRPp1kbG4JwEpAdNlWdLC2RkGcibiehv5iKnA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQRNe9nTqocNc5ar2DRDiFJYC1uMXcDUrLwIMdHlTfL_7w&oe=6B0DB767"}, "display_name": "Frost Survival VR", "keywords": ["survival", "coop", "crafting", "building", "sandbox"], "long_description": "# NEEDS & SURVIVAL\nIsolated from the rest of the world, you must rely on your own wits and limited resources to survive harsh conditions in this **Sandbox Survival**.  \n\nYour main goal is to stay alive, but how?\n\n**Build your Base**: Build a shelter to escape the frost and replenish vital strengths. \n\n**Tools & Weapons**: To survive and fully exploit your surroundings, you will need a variety of tools. \n\n**Hunt, Craft & Gather**: Hunt wild animals to gain food and resources. \n{2415482838807640}\n\n# WINTER & WILDERNESS\n\nStrategizing your moves is crucial to staying alive. **Weather conditions** are unpredictable and change dynamically, so always be prepared! Explore a **huge map**, but remember that not every place is safe; some may be inaccessible based on your current gear.\n\n{1374006587069647}\n\n# SAFE & SANE\nSurvival isn\u2019t just about staying alive, it\u2019s also about **staying sane**.\nIn Frost Survival VR, you must take care of not only your physiological needs but also your mental health. If you neglect it, reality may start to blur with illusion. **Fake sounds** and **creatures** will make survival even more challenging. \n\n{1841986256579353}\n\n# MULTIPLAYER EXPERIENCE\nTry to survive **alone** or **cooperate** with others in a multiplayer experience.\nDo you like playing alone? Don\u2019t worry, there are some uncovered secrets scattered across the frozen wilderness that will help you endure. Or work together with other players. **Shape your survival sandbox experience your way!**\n\n{946707934043394}\n\nThe project is co-funded by the MEDIA strand of the European Union\u2019s Creative Europe Programme. \n\n{1928485044562051}", "short_description": "Sandbox Survival in VR. Face a frozen wilderness solo or in co-op - build a shelter, craft tools, hunt for food, and manage your resources to endure harsh conditions. Strategize your moves against unpredictable weather and lurking dangers. And remember to keep yourself safe and sane!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "http